[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40049939/17d81f0f53327e074dfcb9c21ea3ee1eaaefb74b.png[/img]

Good afternoon everyone, it's been a very long time since we've been in touch and we regret it a lot, this project was not developed in the right way, so to fix or improve it - sometimes it can take a lot of time and effort, and if there are critical issues - it can take months, unfortunately. That's why we are now refactoring the code and the project as a whole, so that we don't have such problems in the future...

[b]We are working hard on the Farm DLC balance, we get a lot of feedback from you, and we are grateful for it. All your wishes and comments have already been taken into account and will be included in this patch.[/b].

We want to apologize for not getting in touch for so long, now everything will be different. Our task is to bring the project to perfection, that's what we are doing now. We can't give you an exact release date for the current patch, because we have encountered a lot of problems and we don't want to give you a bad game, we need some more time. But we are working hard to make it happen as soon as possible.
In parallel with the patch - we started the development of free [b]DLC[/b] for you -[b] Cafe Owner Simulator Hotel DLC[/b], where instead of building next to the cafe - you will be able to open your own hotel, and expand the business even more, the add-on will be completely free and will give Cafe Owner Simulator new colors and possibilities! [b]Cafe Owner Simulator Hotel DLC[/b] will be released almost immediately after the current update.

Also, after the release of the patch - the team that is porting to [b]PlayStation, Xbox and Nintendo Switch[/b] - will take care of porting the new version, so console players will also get the long-awaited update!

[b]The main things that have been done in this patch (not including fixes for critical project issues, optimization, performance and refactoring):[/b]
[list]
[*] added sea level, now you can open a cafe on the beach overlooking the ocean;
[*] working on Cafe Owner Simulator Hotel DLC;
[*] fishing mechanics and catching fish
[*] crabbing
[*] added 5 new seafood dishes;
[*] game saves are now available in multiple slots;
[*] cloud saves on Steam Cloud;
[*] improved visitor feedback balance;
[*] game balance changes (changed store prices and some rewards);
[*] more tasks are now available to complete;
[*] fixes some critical issues with tornadoes;
[*] added a club on the sea level, now in the evenings your visitors can have a good time with loud music in the club on the -1 floor of your establishment;
[*] items could sometimes hang in the air, for example vases with flowers - fixed;
[*] added emotion baubles for visitors;
[*] changed employee avatars;
[*] sounds of footsteps on different surfaces;
[*] reduced and balanced brightness of materials;
[*] added textures for paint materials, now painted wall surface is not so smooth and looks more realistic;
[*] added selling pies in the cafe (cafe counter) instead of removing them;
[*] changed weather system, lighting is more realistic, weather and effects;
[*] added shader “overflow” in the popup window when buying or selling;
[*] new, more realistic water;
[*] added hotkeys for actions in the bottom panel where you can move objects, hire a worker, sell installed equipment, etc;
[*] added the ability to change the light level in lamps;
[*] the janitor could go to the garbage that was removed by the player - fixed;
[*] limited height of urinals installation;
[*] fixed a bug with the waiter, now he gives the dish only if the customer has sat down at the table;
[/list]
[b]In the plans, after the patch and DLC release - adding new content, bug fixes, as well as we want to review some of the mechanics of the game, and try to change and improve them. Working on graphics and immersion in the game.[/b]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40049939/c9f738570adc7c9665dcd7c790ee7151a7696cfa.png[/img]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40049939/332a4da7d2cb3d39860cd039afef816bbe5a4c11.png[/img]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40049939/36de529e74f9b42fa6d3c85c5ad6eea4ed7ea0ea.png[/img]

We are pleased to inform you that we have prepared for you a major update, as promised.
In this patch a lot of work was done on the visual part of the game, new mechanics were added and many bugs were fixed! In the next update we plan to work on new features and additional tasks to perform, most likely it will be possible to reach the level of the restaurant above 10, getting new side jobs, deliver multiple boxes of products at a time and much more.

What has been added:
[list]
[*] completely redesigned the environment, vegetation, lighting, reflections, the game looks noticeably better;
[*] added the ability to expand the area of the restaurant;
[*] added the ability to purchase and install a food truck, to sell go-dogs, burgers and other dishes, this will give new opportunities to earn money;
[*] added new seasonal fittings(Christmas fittings);
[*] added more than 50 new fittings and vegetation, now you can create your own garden where visitors can relax;
[/list]

Thanks to your comments and ideas - a lot of small and large problems have been fixed, now the game runs more stable.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40049939/c3a8c7c9e8126df0db4e34bd15bce978277d6efc.png[/img]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40049939/78775de16cd2d7cd137f8542791dad2c6c12d1e6.png[/img]

We are currently working on new features, improvements to extend the gameplay and make it better. Some fixes have been made in this patch.

Added:
[list]
[*] button Sell to soda machines;
[/list]

Fixed:
[list]
[*] fixed achievements, now they work stable and correctly;
[*] if a homeless man expects you to give him money and you don't, he'll just walk away, changing his opinion of you negatively, before his animation would occasionally break and he'd stand there in a weird pose;
[*] slightly corrected mechanics of calculation of results by fire inspector;
[*] fixed some problems with placing of bonus Kickstarter item;
[*] fixed problems with the Barter skill;
[*] fixed an issue with waiters working behind the counter not connected to the power grid;
[*] cheeseburger price was higher than double cheeseburger price - fixed;
[*] an issue with the restaurant rating system has been fixed, now you can get 4 or 5 stars;
[*] it was possible to place furniture in the wrong place - fixed;
[*] balanced time of giving orders by the cafe worker;
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40049939/e583ecb42bd2d9c44c62762ae76ac2fa864f367e.jpg[/img]

Thank you for your activity on Discord and other communication channels. We have fixed many bugs and made some changes to improve the gameplay.

We made some changes in the game mechanics as we said in the previous post - if you want to continue playing with old saves - please play with version 1.0.213 because the latest version of the game may have some problems with old saves, to play with old saves and an older version of the game - you can use a branch with this version, below will show how to change the branch on Steam. If you want to try a new build and start the game again - just update the game to the latest version and start a new game.

[b]How to change Steam branch: 
Select Properties => Betas => oldbuild (Old build for save compatibility)[/b]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40049939/06cf9511d585d2a43897a6f29d369fe90817bf15.png[/img]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40049939/cbe26c2b3d9d8a833c745a179ce22e4abd4fedd1.png[/img]

[b]In the next update we plan to add new content and features, stay tuned - there are a lot of interesting things to come :)[/b]

Added:
- added waiters;
- added mystery barn for those who supported the game on Kickstarter and purchased Mystery Key;
- ability to sell ingredients from the fridge;
- added two separate ingredient shortage notifications on the cafe counter;
- Added five new tables;

Fixed:
- Conducted a lot of waiter tests and fixed a lot of waiter problems;
- Fixed an issue with the "Fulfill 20 Orders" task;
- Fixed an issue with kitchen workers using broken kitchen equipment;
- fixed an issue where workers would freeze and not show up in the Management window;
- when the equipment broke - sometimes sparks did not appear - fixed;
- after "Catch Rats" task - they no longer appeared - fixed;
- cockroaches did not appear after the player turned off the homeless man in the game settings;
- problem with completing a task at a fast food festival, the task was not completed;
- sometimes the waiter would give the wrong order;
- problem with reaching a new restaurant level;
- sometimes the kitchen worker would give the order instead of the waiter;
- characters now don't get stuck in tables;
- balance of garbage appearing in the restaurant's trash can;
- problem with the "Repair anything broken in the restaurant" task indicator;
- at the time of the "Install Smoke Sensors" task. - player could sell installed smoke detectors, and the counter of installed detectors did not change;
- if installing a coffee counter before the task and selling drinks or desserts, the task breaks;
- balance in marketing work;
- problem with completing a task related to restroom equipment;
- problem with completing a task related to the soda machine;
- fixed a critical problem where the game froze for a moment when a customer was giving an order to the cashier;
- level 4 from the post office - it was impossible to complete the task 100%;
- removed the green indicator from the window displaying the current amount of ingredients;
- problem with duplicate new mail notifications in the mail;
- problem in calculating the amount of payment on invoices;
- problem with setting up items, sometimes it was impossible to set up an item in a vacant space;
- customers getting stuck near the soda machine;
- Problem with installing an air conditioner or TV on the wall near the restroom;
- a problem with installing a jukebox;
- balance the appearance of new customers;
- balanced the performance of the workers you hire with the help of a realtor;
- reduced the size of the cafe counter, it was taking up too much space and didn't look realistic;

[h2]We're excited to announce the big 1.42 update![/h2]

[h3]For over a month we've been working on fixes, adding new features to the game, and preparing for [url=https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/rockgame/cafe-owner-simulator-create-your-restaurant-pc-game?ref=3oo7f1]Kickstarter[/url]. Shortly after the end of the Kickstarter campaign, we plan to release a prologue version of the game on Steam.[/h3]

List of work done in update 1.42:
[list]
[*] fixed an issue with the homeless animations;
[*] text was not displayed in the dialogue with the homeless man - fixed;
[*] fixed problem with giving order to visitor if there is more than 1;
[*] added vending machines that you can install and sell soda;
[*] marks on the floor that visitors leave - now highlighted and easier to see;
[*] added visual effect and sound when plugging equipment into the outlet;
[*] Added a tooltip on where the electrical room is located;
[*] added a grid for installing items;
[*] when two identical items are installed - each next item takes the rotation of the previous one;
[*] balanced the time between the arrival of each visitor;
[*] fixed a lot of bugs in the save system;
[*] new inventory system (now when you press F - a wheel with inventory items to choose from will appear)
[*] new, better quality model of ice cream machine;
[*] added ability to install your restaurant or cafe logo on the building;
[*] corrected errors in the name of sushi;
[*] added loading screen when continuing saved game;
[*] new tutorial system and more hints;
[*] corrected problem with socket falling through the wall;
[*] speed of rats has been reduced, and so has their frequency of appearing;
[*] fixed all bugs with graphics and sound settings, as well as added ability to save settings;
[*] added levels in tablet's store, now to be able to open new equipment or furniture - you need to raise the level of the restaurant;
[*] at the moment the game already has the following languages: Russian, English, Turkish, German, Portuguese, Polish, French, Spanish and Chinese;
[*] added new mechanics, you will be able to buy and install a coffee counter, all the ingredients for making coffee, bake croissants, and sell to visitors. Also - in the coffee machine added a mini-game, the higher your result in which - the higher will be the quality of coffee;
[*] redesigned the cash register.
[/list].
An example of the new interface of checkout:

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40049939/f0d37f3b8e379aeb7f6a0ef7354ab433592864ce.png[/img]

We are working tirelessly to make the game better and more stable.

Here's a list of changes and fixes in the current version:

[list]
[*] the number in the product box has been increased to 20;
[*] dust trails appeared very often and sometimes under the equipment - fixed;
[*] many errors in localization have been fixed;
[*] now you can use Avazon when the establishment is open;
[*] money balance;
[*] fixed walls that could not be painted;
[*] fixed the balance in the delay between each visitor;
[*] fixed problems with some equipment and outlets;
[*] player movement speed has been slightly increased;
[*] new notification design;
[*] removed the loading wheel when installing items and when painting coatings;
[*] now you can buy more than 5 boxes of groceries at once;
[*] rats appear less often.
[/list]

Thanks for your activity and feedback!

[h3]What's new:[/h3]
[list]
[*] A bum lives near the restaurant, he has his own history and secrets. Periodically, he may come and watch you, ask for money or harm your restaurant, so it's better to maintain a good relationship with him or hire restaurant security;
[*] a system of restaurant development levels has been added, your restaurant will receive development points for various actions and achievements, and with each new level, new opportunities and improvements will open up;
[*] work is underway on a cafe, you will be able to equip a coffee counter in your establishment, where visitors can taste aromatic coffee and croissants, do not forget to replenish ingredients and prepare cakes and croissants in time;
[*] a new establishment reputation system has been added, now the reputation is not accumulated, but its average value is simply calculated (from 1 to 5 stars);
[*] bins have been added to the restaurant, which need to be emptied in time;
[*] work is underway on the mechanics of the fire inspection;
[*] new, more advanced system of notifications and hints.
[/list]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40049939/1b320924575b370b3ba8d724c4e16ac723081911.png[/img]

[h1]Update # 4 [/h1]

We have not released updates for a long time, but now we will do it more often and with a certain frequency, most likely once every 1-2 weeks. We are also in full swing preparing for the February demo festival, where we will try to please you with an interesting and worthy demo version of the Cafe Owner Simulator.

[h3] New mechanics and features [/h3]
[list]
[*] added a system for the development of your establishment and the territory around it (expansion of the premises, arrangement of the territory, etc.);
[*] two new game levels;
[*] the plot has been changed and a large level has been added, where you can open your own restaurant and develop it;
[*] added a lot of tasks to complete;
[*] added tool shop;
[*] now rats and cockroaches can grow in the establishment, and you will need to exterminate them;
[*] added a system for the comfort of visitors;
[*] added a tornado that destroys everything in its path;
[*] added delivery service, now you can fully organize delivery in your cafe or restaurant;
[*] now equipment breaks down and requires repair;
[*] added a window where you can see the full statistics of the institution;
[*] added localization in 6 new languages ​​(Spanish, Chinese, German, Portuguese, Japanese and Polish);
[*] now you can take orders at the checkout;
[*] the nature around your cafe comes to life, we have added animals;
[*] added save system;
[*] visitors periodically leave behind dirt and rubbish that need to be removed;
[/list]

[h3] Improvements and fixes [/h3]
[list]
[*] slightly redesigned graphics and lighting;
[*] achievements have been fixed;
[*] many bugs in various systems and mechanics have been fixed;
[*] new interface design;
[*] fixed textures at some levels;
[*] recycled materials on some kitchen equipment;
[/list]

Good day! We did not publish news for a long time, because we were completely immersed in the project and decided before the release of the demo - to release a final update.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40049939/5eb989401ebd0a40ee28d33bd9f22ef2d3799d62.png[/img]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40049939/62366f1d70397cb53509667764dbc9e66f03e58a.png[/img]

What's new:
[list]
[*] added a second game location with a new building and tasks;
[*] electricity system, now the equipment will work only when plugged into an outlet;
[*] new options for the restoration of premises (restoration of the ceiling, foundation, tiles, etc.);
[*] fixed models and animations of all characters in the game;
[*] after purchasing an item in the store, and after installing it - you do not need to re-enter the store and buy it, it will automatically appear in your hands, which will simplify and speed up the process;
[*] fixed bugs when exiting to the main menu, fixed some bugs in the UI;
[*] added the "MENU" function, now you can fully form the menu and prices of your future establishment, at the moment there are about 35 dishes in the menu (including drinks);
[*] installation of items - now work more correctly;
[*] the achievements window blocked the ability to interact with the interface for some time - the problem has been fixed;
[*] for convenience - added highlighting of the last item in the store that you purchased;
[*] in the process of work - garbage cans will be filled in the kitchen of your establishment, you will need to control this and empty them during your work, otherwise the establishment will get dirty;
[*] The work of the "barter" skill has been fixed, when learning which - each next completed task in the game will give you more experience and monetary reward;
[*] changes in the store interface;
[*] the problem when visitors got stuck in place and could not leave the establishment - fixed;
[*] added names for all items in the store.
[/list] and other minor fixes.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40049939/6fee90c3e46c3f05bd2d8b59d7c456ba4da834c1.png[/img]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40049939/2c88fd5da299e91603093129d5430b919bf34485.png[/img]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40049939/06960341607a8c2174971aabc65c04c6ee3b8e5c.png[/img]

[b]Regards,
SECOND REALITY team.[/b]

Good day!

At the moment, a lot of time is spent on testing and fixing critical and non-critical issues in the game. The demo version of the game is almost completely stable, but after testing it in detail - we realized that at some point - the gameplay becomes less interesting and this is not good. Therefore, now - we are working on game mechanics that will not let you get bored (the description will be below), we really want to make [b] Cafe Owner Simulator [/b] - a full-fledged first-person restaurant business simulator!

[b] We are developing a new branch of gameplay - you will have a mobile phone, from time to time you will receive calls from customers who want to place an order for delivery by courier. First, you will need to hire couriers, if possible, purchase transport for them, to speed up the execution of orders. Artificial intelligence of customers will be smart enough and will act in different ways, the client will give his address and ask how long it will take to complete his order, you, in turn, will be able to see on GPS how long it will take for delivery, and see if there are free couriers At the moment. Further - you tell the time of delivery to the client and he agrees or not, which affects the reputation of the establishment, and many other scenarios, this is just an example!

The most important feature is that you will have two options for communicating with clients - a choice of an answer option or a voice response, you will be able to fully respond to the client with a voice using your microphone, and receive an appropriate response! This functionality is still being tested, but we do not see any problems in the foreseeable future, it will be interesting :) [/b]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40049939/adcbf4b533e78fceeb1970f8aade9c490ea2d479.png[/img]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40049939/2c996c334b604d5f1a918ca61e0c64ecfbefe01c.png[/img]


What's new:
[list]
[*] added visual display of the progress of cleaning / restoration / installation of items, etc .;
[*] skill system - the ability to earn experience points and use them to improve the skills of your character;
[*] errors in the work of an advertising agency have been fixed;
[*] the design of all windows in the game has been fixed;
[*] fixed the problem, when some items could be installed in the wrong place;
[*] now, when installing any of the items, you will see a schematic representation of the current area and items around, so that in the future it will be easier for workers to pass from one item to another;
[*] added the ability to complete the order ahead of schedule (having completed at least 50% of the tasks);
[*] many problems in the taskbar have been fixed;
[*] now objects that are installed on walls do not rotate when pressed, but automatically rotate in the desired direction;
[*] fixed the design and functionality of the window where you can order and install the logo / sign of the institution;
[*] added bio toilet;
[*] bugs in toilets have been fixed;
[*] added a lot of sounds when interacting with objects;
[*] added a mop and new types of debris and pollution of premises;
[/list]
and much more...

Thank you for being with us, there is still a lot of interesting things ahead :)

[b] Regards,
SECOND REALITY team. [/b]

Hello!

We are pleased to announce that we are developing a demo version of the game, and soon it will be published on Steam, everyone can try themselves as a novice restaurateur and businessman. The demo consists of one level (order) and will have gameplay lasting 30 minutes. The main part of the planned mechanics has already been implemented in the demo, but you can fully test them in the full version, on larger and more complex levels and tasks.

[b]At the moment we are preparing and testing the demo, finishing the development of the level (the location is not finished), fixing critical bugs and adding some new things![/b]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40049939/66af53c1c3f51c5dc4b50e1ed52fe481fa0c8a2c.png[/img]

 What has been done recently:
[list]
[*] a map of the game world has been created, which includes a schematic representation of all tasks and levels;
[*] a game demo level has been developed;
[*] tasks for the level are developed;
[*] improved lighting and increased performance;
[*] added an indicator of endurance, when cleaning and restoring - the player will get tired;
[*] added a sponge for cleaning;
[*] cleaning, restoration of windows, roofs, restoration of the building;
[*] the taskbar, where you will see the current or completed tasks for the project;
[*] redesign of the tablet and most of its windows;
[*] animation of some characters has been fixed;
[*] bugs in the bank and in the advertising agency have been fixed;
[*] added a system that displays a dialog box with a customer, where you will see a complete description of the task and the goal of the project.
[/list]
And much more!

